OL,3,GNEWSABritish tourist recalls fear
OL,4,Aduring Krakow gun attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British tourist who took refuge
OL,7,Finside a Krakow basilica as a gunman
OL,8,Fopened fire has recalled fearing the
OL,9,Fpacked church would have become his
OL,10,Fnext target.
OL,12,FSix people were killed - including a
OL,13,FBritish national - and several others
OL,14,Finjured when a gunman opened fire in
OL,15,Fcentral Krakow, Poland's second largest
OL,16,Fcity, on Saturday.
OL,18,FJonathan Balshaw, from Ipswich,
OL,19,FSuffolk, was visiting the city with his
OL,20,Fgirlfriend on a surprise trip for his
OL,21,F30th birthday.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
