OL,3,GNEWSABritish tourist recalls fear
OL,4,Aduring Krakow gun attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe couple had been walking back to
OL,7,Ftheir accommodation through the city
OL,8,Fcentre when they heard a series of loud
OL,9,Fbangs and all the pigeons in the square
OL,10,Ftook flight.
